# Refactored Prompt: Migrate All AI Inference from Kilo Gateway → Google Gemini API

> **Objective**: Replace the Kilo Gateway (and OpenAI fallback) with Google's Gemini API as the **sole AI provider** for text generation, image generation, audio/TTS, and embeddings — all routed through a single API key.

---

## 1. Environment Configuration

### 1.1 Update [.env.local](file:///c:/Projects/ApplicationDevelopment/Exam-Killer/.env.local)

Add the new unified key and deprecation marker:

```env
# ===========================================
# Google Gemini Configuration (Unified — ALL AI features)
# Covers: text generation, image generation, audio/TTS, embeddings
# ===========================================
GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY
```

- **Remove** or **comment out** `KILO_API_KEY` and `OPENAI_API_KEY` — they are now deprecated and should no longer be read by any runtime code.
- Keep `PINECONE_*` keys intact (vector store is unchanged).

### 1.2 Update [.env.example](file:///c:/Projects/ApplicationDevelopment/Exam-Killer/.env.example)

Replace the Kilo and OpenAI sections with:

```env
# Google Gemini (Unified AI provider — text, image, audio, embeddings)
# Get key from: https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=
```

Remove the `KILO_API_KEY=` and `OPENAI_API_KEY=` placeholder lines.

